<title>JAPAN: Japan stocks soar as blue chips resume rally.</title>
<headline>Japan stocks soar as blue chips resume rally.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese stocks soared by more than three percent in Friday morning trade as investors resumed a buying spree of blue-chip companies' shares after selling to collect profits the day before, brokers said.</p>
</text>
